et on a encore (cf. (5.8.2.3))

\begin{equation}\tag{5.8.6.3}
\alpha_V^*f^* \mathrm{Prim}^n(X,\mathbb{Q}_\ell(j)) \subset \mathrm{Prim}^n(\widetilde X_V/V,\mathbb{Q}_\ell(j)) \quad ,
